From c87b0dc8e102486399fc9ea93771505396eada3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Farhan <farhanabdm@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 03:45:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gi): buffs for imported custom characters

Imported custom characters can give stat bonuses from their passives and
constellations, for themselves or the whole party. A buff has a stat and
value, optionally scales with the character's ATK/HP/DEF/EM (e.g. 0.7%
per 100 ATK, up to 14%), can be limited to party members of some
elements, and can depend on a named toggle. It applies once its passive
(A1/A4) or constellation is unlocked, and team buffs show under
"Received Team Buffs" like official characters' buffs.

Buffs are edited in the custom character editor. The pack converter adds
hand-written buffs from tools/custom-characters/buffs/<id>.json; this
adds Anastasya's (10000149) from her passive and constellation texts.

Also rounds percentages entered in the editors, so 0.7% is stored as
0.007.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Asb8vZRqeTYT9zLpVizGNv
